1
00:00:10,677 --> 00:00:12,762
When you love
someone deeply,

2
00:00:15,223 --> 00:00:17,392
you can lose your way.

3
00:00:24,774 --> 00:00:27,277
Like you're drifting alone

4
00:00:28,445 --> 00:00:29,904
through a vast,
dark universe.

5
00:00:38,913 --> 00:00:40,373
But maybe
it's in the darkness

6
00:00:42,459 --> 00:00:44,586
that you see them
more clearly,

7
00:00:51,926 --> 00:00:53,511
and find your own heart.

8
00:01:50,401 --> 00:01:51,861
Phil's changed.

9
00:01:53,947 --> 00:01:56,157
He's lost the spark
in his eyes.

10
00:01:57,867 --> 00:02:00,912
Maybe I shouldn't have
come looking for him.

11
00:02:50,670 --> 00:02:51,504
Thanks.

12
00:02:54,716 --> 00:02:56,718
In case you ever
lock yourself out

13
00:02:58,720 --> 00:03:00,221
or lose your key,

14
00:03:03,266 --> 00:03:05,435
I'll still have the spare.

15
00:03:53,541 --> 00:03:58,250
(Two people meet, feel a spark,
and test the waters.)

16
00:03:58,250 --> 00:04:00,750
(I haven't dated much,
but every relationship mattered.)

17
00:04:00,750 --> 00:04:03,083
(Keeping my feelings hidden,
but finding the courage.)

18
00:04:08,708 --> 00:04:11,458
(Not wanting to tell him
what I'm really thinking.)

19
00:04:25,416 --> 00:04:29,250
(Is it too late
to say it now?)

20
00:05:00,717 --> 00:05:02,844
Do you remember
what you once told me?

21
00:05:07,015 --> 00:05:08,266
No matter the past,

22
00:05:08,975 --> 00:05:12,061
the present,
or whatever comes next,

23
00:05:13,563 --> 00:05:17,233
the people who love you
will still love you.

24
00:05:24,949 --> 00:05:26,409
I'm leaving the show.

25
00:05:29,916 --> 00:05:30,708
I'm sorry.

26
00:06:44,445 --> 00:06:45,947
If the probability of meeting

27
00:06:48,625 --> 00:06:50,333
is 4 in 100,000,

28
00:06:57,625 --> 00:06:58,751
the probability of
getting to know each other

29
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:02,463
is 5 in 10 million,

30
00:07:07,969 --> 00:07:11,180
and the probability of falling in love
is only 1 in 1.5 billion,

31
00:07:15,726 --> 00:07:17,228
then what is
the probability

32
00:07:18,479 --> 00:07:20,231
of meeting again?

33
00:11:40,500 --> 00:11:42,250
You were pretty feisty.

34
00:11:43,916 --> 00:11:45,916
Don't label me!

35
00:11:47,625 --> 00:11:48,458
Okay.

36
00:11:48,458 --> 00:11:49,583
Come here.

37
00:11:49,583 --> 00:11:50,666
Give me a second.

38
00:11:51,916 --> 00:11:52,708
Hang on.
